  - Lines 261-269: port allocation to simplify (always ephemeral)
- `src/scanner.rs:6-30` — `scan_repos` — parallel scan with JoinSet
- No other files need changing (BeadStore trait already Send+Sync, pool.rs already uses connect_bead_store)

